          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለምን ፡ እሰድበው ፡ ነበር ፡ አላቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘፀአ ፡ ፳፪ ፡ ፳፰ ። ፪ ፡ ጴጥ ፡ ፪ ፡ ፲ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": "፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፮ ፤ ⟪ወርእዮ ፡ ጳውሎስ ፡ ከመ ፡ አሐዱ ፡ ገጽ ፡ ሰዱ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃውያን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንዱ ፡ ወገን ፡ ሰዱቃውያን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወመንፈቆሙ ፡ ፈሪሳውያን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንዱ ፡ ወገን ፡ ፈሪሳውያን ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኩሎቹ ፡ ሰዱቃውያን ፡ እኩሎቹ ፡ ፈሪ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳውያን ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆኑ ፡ ባየ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከልሐ ፡ በውስተ ፡ ዐውድ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባደባባይ ፡ አሰምቶ ፡ ተናገረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤ ፡ አንሰ ፡ ፈሪሳዊ ፡ ወልደ ፡ ፈሪሳዊ ፡ አነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኔ ፡ የፈሪሳዊ ፡ ልጅ ፡ ፈሪሳዊ ፡ ነኝ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በእንተ ፡ ተስፋ ፡ ሕይወተ ፡ ሙታን ፡ እትኳነን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትንሣኤ ፡ ሙታን ፡ አለ ፡ ብዬ ፡ ስላስተማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርሁ ፡ ይሞት ፡ በቃ ፡ ይፈረድብኛል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ፳፮ ፡ ፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፯ ፤ ⟪ወሶበ ፡ ከመዝ ፡ ይብል ፡ ተበአሱ ፡ ፈሪሳውያን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወሰዱቃውያን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህም ፡ ብሎ ፡ ባስተማረ ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ፈሪ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳውያንና ፡ ሰዱቃውያን ፡ ተጣሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተናፈቁ ፡ ሕዝብ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕዝቡም ፡ ተለያዩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፰ ፤ ⟪እስመ ፡ ሰዱቃውያን ፡ ይብሉ ፡ ኢየሐይዉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙታን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰዱቃውያን ፡ ትንሣኤ ፡ ሙታን ፡ የለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባዮች ፡ ናቸውና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአልቦ ፡ መልአክ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መልአክ ፡ የለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢመንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ የለም፡ ባዮች፡ ናቸውና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወፈሪሳውያንሰ ፡ የአምኑ ፡ ከመ ፡ ቦ ፡ ዝንቱ ፡ ኵሉ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈሪሳውያን ፡ ግን ፡ ይህ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ እንዳለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያምናሉና ፡ ተጣሉ ፡ ማቴ ፡ ፳፪ ፡ ፳፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": "፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፱ ፤ ⟪ወኮነ ፡ ዐቢይ ፡ ዐውያት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታላቅ ፡ ጩኸት ፡ ሆነ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተንሥኡ ፡ ጸሐፍት ፡ ወፈሪሳውያን ፡ ወአኀዙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይትበአሱ ፡ ወይትላኰዩ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸሐፍት ፡ ፈሪሳውያንም ፡ ተነሥተው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጠብ ፡ ክርክር ፡ ጀመሩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤሉ ፡ አልቦ ፡ ዘረከብነ፡ እኩይ፡ ላዕለ፡ ዝ፡ ብእሲ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚህ ፡ ሰው ፡ ላይ ፡ ያገኘነው ፡ ክፉ ፡ ነገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ር ፡ የለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እንዳዒ ፡ ለእመ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ተናገሮ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ አናግሮት ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪አው ፡ መልአክ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወይም ፡ መላክ ፡ አናግሮት ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አናውቅም ፡ እግዚአብሔርን ፡ እንጣላ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሉ ፡ ም ፡ ፳፭ ፡ ፳፭ ። ም ፡ ፭ ፡ ፴፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": "፲",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲ ፤ ⟪ክፍል ፡ ፶፭ ። ወሶበ ፡ ተሀውኩ ፡ ፈድፋደ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እጅግ ፡ በታወኩ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ፈርሀ ፡ መልአክ ፡ ኢይምስጥዎ ፡ ለጳውሎስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጳውሎስን ፡ ነጥቀው ፡ እንዳይወስዱት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈርቶ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአዘዘ ፡ ሠገራተ ፡ ይምጽኡ ፡ ወይንሥእዎ ፡ እማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕከሎሙ ፡ ወይሰድዎ ፡ ኀበ ፡ ምኵናን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጥተው ፡ ከመካከላቸው ፡ ነጥቀው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደ ፡ ግዞት ፡ ቤት ፡ ይወስዱት ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውሰዱት ፡ ብሎ ፡ ጭፍሮቹን ፡ አዘዘ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": "፲፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፩ ፤ ⟪ወበካልእት ፡ ሌሊት ፡ አስተርአዮ ፡ እግዚእነ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለጳውሎስ ፡ ወይቤሎ ፡ ተአመን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሁለተኛው ፡ ሌሊት ፡ ጌታችን ፡ በራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እይ ፡ ታይቶ ፡ አይዞህ ፡ ጽና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በከመ ፡ ኮንከኒ ፡ ሰማዕትየ ፡ በኢየሩሳሌም ፡ ከማሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሀለወከ ፡ ትኩነኒ ፡ ሰማዕትየ ፡ በሮሜሂ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
